  "solution": "**Letter**\n\n \n \n \nA\n\n \n \n \nB\n\n \n \n \nC\n\n \n \n \nD\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\nAfter replacing the letters by their meaning, we get:\n\n__**118 ÷ 2**__ + 14 - 5 × 8 = ?\n\n⇒ 59 + 14 - __**5 **____**×**____** 8**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**59**____** +**____** 14**__ - 40 = ?\n\n⇒ __**73 -**____** 40**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 33 = ?\n\nHence, '**33**' is the correct answer.",
